Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:30:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 22/31] PS4: A2B10G10R10 render/sample self-test with automatic
 view workarounds; per-frame texture-cache audit with page-level history; fix
 SlotVector::begin distance

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/common/slot_vector.h                      |   2 +-
 .../renderer_vulkan/vk_texture_cache.cpp      | 208 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/video_core/texture_cache/texture_cache.h  |  93 +++++++-
 3 files changed, 296 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/common/slot_vector.h b/src/common/slot_vector.h
index f6da7a5..542b33a 100644
--- a/src/common/slot_vector.h
+++ b/src/common/slot_vector.h
